<Layouts.app current_url={@current_url}>
  <article class="relative">
    <header>
      <.page_intro label="About" title="I'm Florian." />
    </header>

    <div class="mt-10 flex flex-col gap-12 lg:flex-row lg:gap-16">
      <div class="flex-1 space-y-6">
        <p class="text-base-content/70 leading-relaxed">
          I work as a Lead Engineer at <.link
            href="https://naymspace.de/"
            target="_blank"
            rel="noopener noreferrer"
            class="underline"
          >naymspace</.link>,
          where I take technical responsibility for internal and client projects from concept to implementation.
          I contribute to technical discussions and solution design with clients, helping turn ideas and requirements into practical solutions.
        </p>

        <p class="text-base-content/70 leading-relaxed">
          I approach engineering with an entrepreneurial mindset. For me, that means considering quality,
          effort, and business value when making technical decisions. I work across technologies and choose
          tools and approaches based on what each project needs.
        </p>

        <p class="text-base-content/70 leading-relaxed">
          AI is a practical part of my work. I use it for implementation and quality assurance, evaluate
          and test new AI tools and features, and refine the workflows around them. My goal is to make
          software development more efficient while maintaining a strong focus on quality.
        </p>

        <p class="text-base-content/70 leading-relaxed">
          I’m also the primary developer and technical lead of <.link
            href="https://github.com/naymspace/backpex"
            target="_blank"
            rel="noopener noreferrer"
            class="underline"
          >Backpex</.link>,
          an open-source admin panel for Phoenix LiveView applications. It’s used in production in internal and client projects.
        </p>

        <p class="text-base-content/70 leading-relaxed">
          I hold a B.Sc. and an M.Sc. in Applied Computer Science. My experience includes research projects
          and professional work as a Software Developer and Lead Engineer, both independently and as part of a team.
        </p>

        <p class="text-base-content/70 leading-relaxed">
          Outside of work, I enjoy exploring new technologies and attending conferences and meetups.
          Away from the computer, I find balance in cycling, strength training, badminton, and cooking.
        </p>

        <div class="pt-4">
          <.link
            navigate={~p"/projects"}
            class={[
              "inline-flex items-center gap-2",
              "text-primary font-medium",
              "hover:gap-3",
              "transition-[color,gap] duration-200",
              "motion-reduce:transition-none"
            ]}
          >
            View my projects <.icon name="hero-arrow-right" class="size-4" />
          </.link>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="mx-auto w-64 md:w-72 lg:mx-0 lg:w-80 lg:flex-shrink-0">
        <div class={[
          "group relative",
          "lg:rotate-2 lg:hover:-rotate-1",
          "transition-[rotate] duration-500"
        ]}>
          <div class="from-primary/20 to-secondary/20 bg-linear-to-br absolute inset-0 rounded-2xl opacity-50 blur-xl transition-opacity duration-500 group-hover:opacity-70" />

          <img
            loading="eager"
            class={[
              "relative",
              "aspect-square w-full object-cover",
              "rounded-2xl",
              "shadow-base-content/10 shadow-2xl",
              "ring-base-content/5 ring-1"
            ]}
            src="/images/me.jpg"
            alt="Portrait of Florian"
          />
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </article>
</Layouts.app>
